# Project Details: AssetWorks Portal (EV Charging Management System)

## Project Overview
**AssetWorks** is a comprehensive **Enterprise EV (Electric Vehicle) Charging Management Portal** - a multi-role web application for managing electric vehicle charging infrastructure. The platform provides role-based access for Super Admins, Admins, and Operators to manage charging stations, locations, assets, users, subscriptions, and billing.

