## 📱 Application Modules & Features

### 1. Authentication Module
- **Login** with role-based redirect
- **Forgot Password** functionality
- **Change Password**
- **OTP Verification**
- **JWT Token Interceptor** for API security
- **Role-based Route Guards**

### 2. Dashboard Module (Admin/Operator)
- **Area Chart** - Revenue/trend visualization
- **Bar Chart** - Comparative data
- **Line Chart** - Time-series data
- **Stacked Area Chart** - Multi-series trends
- **Meter Chart** - Gauge/progress indicators
- **Status Boxes** - Quick stats (Energy, Points, Graph, Elements)
- **Data Tables** with sorting, filtering, export
- **Transaction Dialogs** - Transaction details

### 3. Admin Module Features
- **Customer Management** - Add/Edit customers
- **Location Management** - Manage charging locations
- **Charger Management** - EV charger administration
- **Asset Management** - Hardware assets tracking
- **Pricing Management** - Rate configuration
- **Subscription Plans** - User subscription handling
- **Admin Users** - System administrators
- **Operator Users** - Field operators
- **Reports** - Analytics and reporting
- **Diagnostics** - System health checks
- **Help Section** - User documentation

### 4. Super Admin Module
- **Client Billing** - Billing management for clients
- **Manage Admin Users** - Super admin user control
- **Billing Lists** - Invoice management

### 5. Common Features
- **Master Layout** with navigation
- **Common Diagnostics** - Cross-module diagnostics
- **Interactive Maps** with marker clustering

