## 🏗️ Architecture & Best Practices

### Project Structure
```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── component/          # Reusable components
│   ├── screen/             # Feature modules
│   │   ├── admin/          # Admin module
│   │   ├── super-admin/    # Super admin module
│   │   ├── operator/       # Operator module
│   │   └── login/          # Authentication
│   ├── service/            # Business logic services
│   ├── gurads/             # Route guards
│   └── shared/             # Shared modules
├── environments/           # Environment configs
└── assets/                 # Static assets
```

### Key Architectural Features
- **Lazy Loading** - Modules loaded on demand
- **Route Guards** - Role-based access control
- **HTTP Interceptors** - Token management
- **Modular Design** - Feature-based organization
- **Strict TypeScript** - Type safety enabled
- **Responsive Design** - SCSS styling

